WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.650
Running time counts the milliseconds since the micro:bit switched on.

2
00:00:05.527 --> 00:00:09.027
A stores it in start, the moment the timing begins.

3
00:00:11.810 --> 00:00:16.135
B shows running time minus start. That is how long since A.

4
00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:19.865
A thousand milliseconds is one second.
